3. TOOLING, WEBSITE AND REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION

The TIR-CMM assessment tooling, website implementation and reference implementation are source-available / all rights reserved unless an explicit licence states otherwise. The canonical site describes them as free to run, self-host and audit, but not licensed for redistribution, rebranding or resale as another product.

The presence of public framework documentation in this repository does not change that tooling licence.

